hi everyone  welcome to yet another video tutorial on  the top 10 reasons to learn python in  2022 python's popularity has grown  exponentially over the past few years  and is being widely used in different  jobs  so this video will focus on the  different reasons why it is important to  learn python in 2022 let's begin  the first reason we have is python is  versatile  python is a totally versatile language  as it has been used widely in artificial  intelligence data science machine  learning web development embedded  systems graphic design applications data  mining gaming and others  python is used as an easier and more  effectively written alternative to  languages that perform similar  functionalities like r and java  now talking about the  second reason why you should learn  python in 2022 we have python is the  fastest growing programming language  python programming has  become one of the fastest growing  programming languages in the world and  is the primary language for many  applications  its popularity has grown both in india  as well as in the us  in january 2021 python was in the third  position in the dob index in january  2022 which is this year python has  become number one in the top index of  popular programming languages  the ratings are based on the number of  skilled engineers worldwide  courses and third party vendors  popular search engines such as google  bing yahoo wikipedia amazon youtube and  baidu are used to calculate the  ratings coming to our  third reason that is python is beginner  friendly  the main reason why python is an  excellent choice for beginners is its  simplicity  python supports english syntax and is  designed to be concise and easy to read  all of which make it more accessible to  first-time coders  it is an interpreted programming  language this means that you can run  each line of code once you have finished  writing it allowing you to immediately  check it and make adjustments if needed  the fourth reason we have is python  libraries and frameworks  python provides numerous libraries and  frameworks that cater to every need of  the user and its clients  it has numpy and pandas for numerical  computation and data manipulation scipy  for scientific computation matplotlib  and c-bond for data visualization  scikit-learn for machine learning stats  model for statistical analysis and much  more  python also supports frameworks such as  flask and xango for web applications  you can also do cross platform and cross  browser testing with frameworks like pi  test and robot  now moving ahead  the fifth reason we have is python for  data visualization  python is a great programming language  for data analysis and data visualization  so it supports libraries such as  matplotlab c-bond bokeh and plotly for  creating interesting visualizations  you can make sense of complex datasets  and visualize your findings through  various representation options like bar  graph pie charts graphical plots  geographical maps and much more  now moving ahead  the sixth reason we have is  extensive online documentation  python has been adapted to the latest  advancements with developers  continuously releasing new and improved  versions  python language is very organized and  its libraries have co-existing  documentation letting you jump start  straight into programming  you will also find example codes where  you can see the functions implemented so  reading the documentation is a good way  to improve your knowledge about python  moving on to the seventh reason why you  should learn python in 2022 we have  python is great for scripting  python is also used to write scripts to  do automated tasks such as backups and  cleanup in servers  in python you don't have to compile the  code in order to interpret it you can  directly write code in the script and  execute it the machine reads interprets  and runs the required tests and also  performs error checking  now coming to the eighth reason we have  python for cybersecurity  python has been dominating the  cybersecurity industry and has been  around for a long time now  it can help to automate tasks across the  cyber attack life cycle for both cyber  attackers and defenders  you can develop custom python scripts to  automate cyber security tasks with  libraries such as nmap yara scapy and  twisted  python is used heavily in malware  analysis host discovery  sending and decoding of packets  accessing servers and network scanning  now moving on to our ninth reason we  have  python community support  you always need a community to learn new  technology and friends are your best  asset when it comes to learning a  programming language  the python programming language has a  global community with millions of  software developers who interact online  and offline in thousands of virtual and  physical locations  in case of any coding related issues you  can always seek help from the python  community  as shown on the screen python has a  robust and supportive online community  with over 1.5 million github repository  communities such as stack overflow also  brings several python experts together  to help newbies  now moving on to the  10th reason in our list we have python  jobs in high demand  as python is getting more popular along  with an increase in an active community  and its functions the demand for python  professionals is also increasing  python jobs are increasingly growing in  every business sector and provide high  salaries  python developers is one of the highest  paid jobs in the united states  the average salary of a python developer  in the us is over 96 000  so those were our top 10 reasons to  learn python in 2022 i hope this video  was useful thanks for watching  hi there if you like this video  subscribe to the simply learn youtube  channel and click here to watch similar  videos turn it up and get certified  click here

